New homepage built from the V4 design, driven by the same live data as
before (courses, workshops, studio, shop and venture items, tax settings,
footer links, ticker, bio).

- Hero: a spiral of Deepanshu's own lines compresses into the headline
  (CSS-only, so it plays before hydration; "how I think" replays it).
- Start-here tiles and a phone bottom tab bar with scroll-spy.
- Course shelf (any number of courses): Enroll opens the existing
  CheckoutModal directly; Details opens a sheet with real forWho /
  notForWho / outcomes / curriculum from the item.
- Live ticket: only a future workshop is ever offered; a past one is
  shown as "previously". No date → WhatsApp waitlist.
- Studio demo, Shipped wall, Off-the-build section, note, footer.
- Scoped CSS (.v4) and homepage-only fonts; rest of the site unchanged.
  Respects prefers-reduced-motion.

